cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Supplement label dataset: label facts of 201 best-selling supplements and 99 protein bar flavors"
authors:
  - name: "HealthWorld"
    website: "https://www.healthworldlabels.com"
abstract: >-
  Label facts read off the Supplement Facts and Nutrition Facts panels of best-selling US supplements and protein
  bars: protein and calories per serving, protein per 100 kcal, the doses printed for creatine, magnesium, vitamin D,
  omega-3 and others, and the third-party certifications printed on the pack. Sources are the brand's own page, the
  NIH Dietary Supplement Label Database (DSLD) or Open Food Facts. No lab testing.
version: "2026.11.24"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24506859"
url: "https://www.healthworldlabels.com/data/supplement-labels"
repository: "https://github.com/EvyatarHaim1/supplement-labels"
keywords:
  - dietary supplements
  - supplement facts
  - nutrition labels
  - protein
  - protein bars
  - creatine
  - vitamins
  - open data
